---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>Adopt a church.</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">
        Old churches are for sale all over Europe, and most of them cost less than a parking space in
        San Francisco. They are cheap because they are a liability. The roof leaks, the congregation is
        eleven people, and whoever holds the deed would like someone else to pay for the gutters.
      </p>
      <p class="standfirst">I think more people should.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/shortlist/">See the shortlist</a>
        <a class="plain-link" href="/why/">Read the argument</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lancet-col" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="lancet">
        <span class="numeral">You buy it. You fix the roof. You keep the door open.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ways">
    <div>
      <h2>A shortlist</h2>
      <p>
        We read the listings, check the heritage status, and write down what is wrong with each
        building and what it will cost to put right.
      </p>
      <a href="/shortlist/">Churches you could buy</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Who is selling</h2>
      <p>
        In France the Church has not owned its old parish churches since 1905. Every profile names
        the seller and says where the money goes.
      </p>
      <a href="/who-owns-the-churches/">Who owns the churches</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>No spare chapel money?</h2>
      <p>
        Give to the people who rescue the churches nobody else will take. Membership costs less than
        dinner.
      </p>
      <a href="/donate/">Support the rescuers</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
